# mirai-station — runtime artifacts that regenerate on the mini

# venv lives outside the repo, but be defensive
.venv/
venv/

# python build artifacts
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo

# pytest
.pytest_cache/

# macOS
.DS_Store

# Logs & rolling state — written on the mini, never synced from main.
# 2026-07-10: the whole data tree (state/ until 2026-10-11, data/ since) is runtime data
# (minute bars, diaries, the raw tape, the job logs; hundreds of MB and churning) —
# machine-local, never versioned.
data/
state/

# Per-pipeline caches and run history that regenerate from live data
data_collectors/schwab_market_data_client/cache/
pipelines/spx_options_scanner/logs/

# The built phone shell, served from the station so a phone can install it over
# the same front door. It is the one file under static/ that contains the
# station password in plain text, so it must never be committable — the scrub
# refuses a TRACKED apk, but an untracked one sitting in `git status` is an
# invitation, and screens/android_phone_app/.gitignore only reaches its own directory.
screens/desktop_and_phone_server/static/m/*.apk

# The scanner's rolling intraday state. It is runtime data like everything under
# data/ — hunter.load_state() returns a fresh day when the file is absent and
# resets it at 09:30 ET anyway — but it lived here, beside the code, and so was
# tracked by accident rather than by decision. What it holds is a live signal:
# which direction armed, on which instrument, at which second. Four commits
# published one before 2026-09-04, and with development moving to the public
# repo a `git commit -a` would publish today's.
pipelines/spx_options_scanner/state.json

# Secrets kept out of git: the JEV key lives in pipelines/spx_jev_questions_and_pools/.env (see .env.example),
# and in the retired skills/sndk-jev/.env until that folder goes
.env
.env.*
!.env.example

# built artifact pages, regenerated by the scheduled rebuild (retired skills/sndk-jev)
skills/sndk-jev/page/*.html

# page and diagram builders: development aids, never committed (Will, 2026-09-26)
docs/artifact_and_diagram_builders_not_in_git/
